We need to determine criminal charge(s) based on Chinese criminal law. Facts: contractor built without permit, no safety supervision, used unqualified personnel for special operations, high scaffold collapsed causing death. This is likely "以危险方法危害公共安全罪" (dangerous method endangering public safety) or "重大责任事故罪" (major liability accident). Under Chinese law, causing death due to safety violations in construction is "以危险方法危害公共安全罪" (Article 119 of Criminal Law) or "重大责任事故罪" (Article 133). Actually Article 119: "违反安全管理规定，因而发生重大事故，致人重伤、死亡或者使公私财产遭受重大损失的，处三年以下有期徒刑或者拘役；情节特别恶劣的，处三年以上七年以下有期徒刑。" That's "以危险方法危害公共安全罪". Also there is "非法经营罪"? No. The appropriate charge is "以危险方法危害公共安全罪". Also possibly "过失致人死亡罪"? In Chinese law, "过失致人死亡罪" applies to negligence causing death, but for construction safety violations, they often charge "以危险方法危害公共安全罪". The facts mention no permit, unqualified personnel, high scaffold insufficient rigidity, leading to death. That matches "以危险方法危害公共安全罪". Could also be "非法占用农用地罪"? No.

Thus answer: single charge.

